  "description_short": "Laid-back grill house on Sedgefield's main drag serving hearty steaks, ribs, and cold beers in relaxed surrounds.",
  "description_long": "Texas Grill brings a touch of American steakhouse charm to Sedgefield's Main Street, where the smell of wood-fired grills and the buzz of conversation spill out onto the pavement. The menu focuses on generous cuts of beef, fall-off-the-bone ribs, and flame-grilled burgers, all served without fuss in a casual bar-and-grill setting that feels equally right for families midweek or mates catching the game on weekends.\n\nThe atmosphere strikes a comfortable balance between neighbourhood local and proper grill house, with a bar that stocks local craft beers alongside the usual suspects. Portions are honest and prices won't frighten anyone, making it a reliable spot when you're craving something meaty and satisfying. Located right in the heart of Sedgefield, it's the kind of place where you drop in for a steak and end up staying for another round, especially when the kitchen's flame is doing its thing.",
